From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chad Cormier Roussel <chadcormierroussel@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 17:49:58 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] mtld3d: mtld3d 0.14.1, Direct3D 9 on Metal (zlib), under
 mtld3d/.

github.com/athei/mtld3d, release 0.14.1: a Direct3D 9 for Wine on
macOS, its d3d9.dll and mtld3d.dll PE pair over a native mtld3d.so on
Metal, built by its own Makefile over two Cargo workspaces. Imported as
one commit (the squash of git subtree), so `git subtree pull --squash
--prefix=mtld3d` takes later releases; its licence is mtld3d/LICENSE.

git-subtree-dir: mtld3d
git-subtree-split: 0c172127c68c98be50b98ccfcfb7c1d517c85f57
