+# mtld3d d3d9 conformance baseline — per-site failure counts.
+# Wine: wine-11.19-17-gd57b522eea5
+# Regenerate with 'make conformance-baseline'. Classifications + triage prose
+# live in CONFORMANCE.md ('Per-cluster classification'); a runner unit test
+# keeps the two files covering the same sites.
+# Format: "[leg/subtest] crash=<0|1>" header, then indented
